  "description": "Chainlink CSR contracts behind Lido's CCIP Direct Staking. Two build layouts land in one cohort: contracts compiled from this repo carry npm 'node_modules/...' paths, while PausableImmutableOraclePool was compiled from lidofinance/l2-direct-staking and carries 'lib/chainlink-csr/...' submodule paths for the same files. The self-referential 'lib/chainlink-csr' key maps the latter back onto this repo at the cohort's own commit, so both layouts resolve without splitting the cohort. Package versions follow this repo's package.json (@openzeppelin/contracts ^5.0.2, @openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable ^5.0.2, @chainlink/contracts-ccip ^1.4.0, @chainlink/contracts ^1.1.1). '@chainlink/contracts-ccip' needs its own key but cannot collide with '@chainlink/contracts': Diffyscan matches the longest dependency prefix followed by '/'. Dependencies are pinned per commit because the self-reference must track the cohort commit, and a commit-scoped map replaces the default outright rather than merging.",
